{"id":"lgak","title":"Log global alignment score","family":"kernel","definition":"reference","intro_en":"Log GAK applies a logarithm to the positive sum of alignment weights. The underlying computation still uses sum-product dynamic programming, so all admissible paths contribute. This card uses Cuturi's modified Gaussian local kernel and reports log of the unnormalized path sum, with a stated tiny epsilon for numerical definition.","intro_zh":"Log GAK 对正的对齐权重总和取对数。底层仍使用求和—乘积动态规划，因此全部允许路径共同贡献。本卡采用 Cuturi 的修正高斯局部核，报告未归一化路径和的对数，并明确微小 epsilon 的数值约定。","steps_en":["Build phi=exp(-squared_cost/(2*sigma^2)) with sigma=1, then kappa=phi/(2-phi).","Multiply each local kappa by the sum of its three predecessor path weights.","Accumulate every monotone alignment; do not replace the sum with a maximum or minimum.","Apply log(K+epsilon) to compress the positive output scale."],"steps_zh":["用 sigma=1 构造 phi=exp(-平方代价/(2*sigma^2))，再令 kappa=phi/(2-phi)。","每个局部 kappa 乘以三个前驱路径权重之和。","累加全部单调对齐，不能将求和换成最大或最小值。","应用 log(K+epsilon) 压缩正输出的量级。"],"formula":"log(K_GA+1e-12), K_GA=sum_paths product(phi/(2-phi)), phi=exp(-(x_i-y_j)^2/2)","caveats_en":["The logarithm does not generally preserve positive semidefiniteness; log GAK is a score transformation, not an automatic Mercer kernel.","Raw path sums depend strongly on sequence length and can overflow for long inputs; log-domain computation and self-normalization are distinct remedies."],"caveats_zh":["取对数一般不保留半正定性；log GAK 是分数变换，不自动成为 Mercer 核。","原始路径和强烈依赖长度，长输入可能溢出；对数域计算和自相似归一化是不同处理方式。"],"sources":[{"label":"Cuturi (2011): local-kernel conditions for global alignment","url":"https://marcocuturi.net/Papers/cuturi11fast.pdf"},{"label":"EchoTime imported atlas: named formula conventions","url":"https://github.com/ZipengWu365/EchoTime/blob/main/src/echotime/data/ts_similarity_package_v2_registry.csv"}],"x":[0.2,0.4,1.1,2.4,3.2,2.5,1.2,0.3,-0.4,-0.1],"y":[0.1,0.3,0.5,1.2,2.6,3.1,2.3,1.1,0.2,-0.3],"input_label":"Deterministic illustrative arrays; no benchmark data","parameters":{"sigma":1.0,"local_kernel":"phi/(2-phi)","normalization":"none","hard_path_band":null,"epsilon":1e-12,"raw_gak":3739.5094447576153},"result":{"label":"kernel score","value":8.22670971730245,"detail":"The explicit definition and parameters shown on this card."},"frames":[{"phase":0,"caption":"Convert local squared discrepancy using phi/(2-phi)","panel":{"kind":"matrix","title":"Modified Gaussian local similarities","z":[[0.9900744622116082,0.9900744622116082,0.9157041915106461,0.43526659839358384,0.02887790869493483,0.007516468846359594,0.05834134459661612,0.5003489933944892,1.0,0.7897042116712348],[0.9157041915106461,0.9900744622116082,0.9900744622116082,0.5700423818855314,0.04652955015961862,0.013233544344784166,0.08960619325974989,0.6429864916372999,0.9611663052891852,0.6429864916372999],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null]],"row_label":"x index","col_label":"y index"}},{"phase":0,"caption":"Convert local squared discrepancy using phi/(2-phi)","panel":{"kind":"matrix","title":"Modified Gaussian local similarities","z":[[0.9900744622116082,0.9900744622116082,0.9157041915106461,0.43526659839358384,0.02887790869493483,0.007516468846359594,0.05834134459661612,0.5003489933944892,1.0,0.7897042116712348],[0.9157041915106461,0.9900744622116082,0.9900744622116082,0.5700423818855314,0.04652955015961862,0.013233544344784166,0.08960619325974989,0.6429864916372999,0.9611663052891852,0.6429864916372999],[0.43526659839358384,0.5700423818855311,0.7171364719909384,0.9900744622116082,0.1937821622278245,0.07257888349575384,0.3216606519831669,1.0,0.5003489933944892,0.2310049010527